        <h2>
          Usage
        </h2>
        <div class="rules">
          <div class="yes">
            <b>            Do
</b>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Keep clear space of at least half the R&#39;s width on every side.
              </li>
              <li>
                Place the black R on white or any light background; use the reversed R on dark.
              </li>
              <li>
                Scale the SVG; it stays sharp at any size.
              </li>
              <li>
                Drop the green dot below 16px, where it stops reading.
              </li>
              <li>
                Minimum size: 16px for the R, 120px wide for the lockup.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="no">
            <b>            Don&#39;t
</b>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Recolour the R or the dot — only black, white and the brand green.
              </li>
              <li>
                Stretch, rotate, outline, or straighten the torn edge.
              </li>
              <li>
                Place the logo on a busy photo without a solid panel.
              </li>
              <li>
                Rebuild the wordmark in another typeface.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
